      "annotations": [
        {
          "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.iiif.json/notes/2",
          "type": "AnnotationPage",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.iiif.json/note/4",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Enter the network and security details</h3><p>Enter the network name exactly. Choose the correct security type and add the password when the guest network requires one.</p><p>The joining details match the guest network.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.html#step-4\">Follow this step in Show a Guest Wi-Fi QR Code on a Hotel or Meeting-Room TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.iiif.json/note/5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Add a caption and show the code</h3><p>Use a clear caption such as Guest Wi-Fi: scan to join. Choose Show now and check the code is visible where guests stand.</p><p>Guests can identify the joining code.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.html#step-5\">Follow this step in Show a Guest Wi-Fi QR Code on a Hotel or Meeting-Room TV</a></p>"
              },
              "target": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.iiif.json/canvas/2"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.iiif.json/note/6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "commenting",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "format": "text/html",
                "language": "en",
                "value": "<h3>Test joining with another phone</h3><p>Scan from a separate compatible phone. Confirm it offers the correct network and complete any venue sign-in steps that network requires.</p><p>The guest joining route has been tested.</p><p><a href=\"https://vuthis.github.io/walkthrough-guest-wifi-qr-on-tv.html#step-6\">Follow this step in Show a Guest Wi-Fi QR Code on a Hotel or Meeting-Room TV</a></p>"
              },
